# Production builds pull media from the Bunny pull zone rather than shipping
# ~40 MB of clips through the site host.
#
# Replace with your pull zone hostname (Bunny dashboard → CDN → your zone).
# The storage zone itself (storage.bunnycdn.com/beuwy) is write-only plumbing —
# never point the browser at it, it needs the access key.
VITE_MEDIA_BASE=https://beuwy.b-cdn.net/p96
